; GRAVITY SLINGSHOT - InfyCPU-2 / Infy Assembly (.iasm)
; Suggested settings: screen_width=64, screen_length=48, rom_size=512
; Controls: tap any key to fire the thruster (adds right/up impulse).
; Goal: reach the green beacon at the upper-right without hitting a planet.
; Red planet and blue moon have simplified rectangular gravity fields.

BLTI 5 5
BLTR 7 0
VSTI 7 5
BLTI 12 8
BLTR 7 0
VSTI 7 7
